       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RETCODE.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 S-VAR PIC X(5) VALUE 'HELLO'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 42 TO RETURN-CODE.
           DISPLAY 'BEFORE RC=' RETURN-CODE.
           CALL 'SUBNO'.
           DISPLAY 'AFTER SUBNO RC=' RETURN-CODE.
           CALL 'SUBSET'.
           DISPLAY 'AFTER SUBSET RC=' RETURN-CODE.
           CALL 'SUBSHT' USING BY REFERENCE S-VAR.
           DISPLAY 'S-VAR=' S-VAR.
           STOP RUN.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUBNO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY 'IN SUBNO RC=' RETURN-CODE.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SUBNO.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUBSET.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 7 TO RETURN-CODE.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SUBSET.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUBSHT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 L-VAR PIC X(10).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-VAR.
           MOVE 'WORLD' TO L-VAR(1:5).
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM SUBSHT.
